Delhi", "location_name_detailed": "New Delhi, India"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/02/2e/d9/photo0jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/02/2e/da/photo1jpg.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2019-11-12", "published_at_date": "2019-11-12"}, {"review_id": 725596184, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r725596184-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Great place to see how life is celebrated by honouring the recently dead.", "text": "This is a must for anybody who visits Kathmandu. The people here are honouring the life of the recently departed, observe from a distance and be respectful, please!", "review_tip": null, "rating": 4, "subratings": [], "like_count": 0, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": null, "stay_date": "2019-10-31"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "646C5B99224D02B760C86C7C5FA3A867", "name": "Herbie C", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/Herbie20023", "username": "Herbie20023", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f2/eb/default-avatar-2020-27.jpg", "contribution_count": 40, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 255055, "location_name": "Australia", "location_name_detailed": "Australia"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": [], "created_at_date": "2019-11-11", "published_at_date": "2019-11-11"}, {"review_id": 725452829, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r725452829-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valley_Bagmati_Zone_Central_Region.html", "title": "Fabulous", "text": "Visited at 10.00am and we were dropped off at the car park. Chilled walk up the street in between market stalls. 1000 entrance fee easily paid, which we thought was worth every penny. \nTour guide offered his services, but a simple ‘no thank you’ and off we went. \nWe watched in amazement and everybody was so friendly. In total we spent two and a half hours, which we will not forget. \nEasy to get a taxi for the return journey, just head back to the car park. \nIt was a privilege to watch the ceremony so closely and to learn so much about their faith. \nDefinitely worth a visit, my only criticism would be the ignorant tourists with big cameras intruding. People are saying goodbye to loved ones- yes we are interested and want to share our story, but a respectful distance should go without saying!", "review_tip": null, "rating": 5, "subratings": [], "like_count": 2, "language": "en", "is_translated": false, "original_language": "en", "owner_response": null, "trip": {"trip_type": "couples", "stay_date": "2019-11-30"}, "reviewer": {"reviewer_id": "EA5541A9C074219B7D7DEE908BB2439A", "name": "1234emma", "profile_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/Profile/1234emma", "username": "1234emma", "avatar": "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/1a/f6/f3/e4/default-avatar-2020-30.jpg", "contribution_count": 767, "hometown": {"tripadvisor_entity_id": 186217, "location_name": "England", "location_name_detailed": "England, United Kingdom"}, "is_verified": false}, "images": ["https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/fd/5f/27/photo0jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/fd/5f/29/photo1jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/fd/5f/2a/photo2jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/fd/5f/2b/photo3jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/fd/5f/2c/photo4jpg.jpg", "https://dynamic-media-cdn.tripadvisor.com/media/photo-o/19/fd/5f/2d/photo5jpg.jpg"], "created_at_date": "2019-11-10", "published_at_date": "2019-11-10"}, {"review_id": 725310967, "review_link": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g293890-d310712-r725310967-Pashupatinath_Temple-Kathmandu_Kathmandu_Valle